{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Contact Cleaner 是一款以滑卡方式整理通訊錄的工具，適合想快速清理重複、缺漏或雜亂聯絡人的 iPhone 使用者；目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-34.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>滑動卡片整理通訊錄</h2>\n<p>開啟滑卡介面後，向右保留、向左移除聯絡人；重複項目可按姓名、電話或電郵一鍵合併，並保留所有號碼與電郵。程式亦設重複、無姓名、缺電話、缺電郵及僅公司等分類，支援 A-Z 搜尋、多選批量移除、備份匯出 .vcf 及選擇性還原。已移除項目會先放入垃圾桶，確認清空後才真正刪除，亦可隨時還原。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Contact Cleaner: Merge Dupes</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/contact-cleaner-merge-dupes/id6755306887?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:41:15.880071+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:33:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:37.844186+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:37.844186+00:00","content_hash":"3c4acc30f5b613d00e21562098513637a32af535b7bac9521f2b063470f99536","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}